+	/*
+	 * These keys read exactly 0.00 C on the J604, in the macOS 27.0.1 key
+	 * dump and on Linux alike: unpopulated slots, not temperatures. Report
+	 * them as no data instead of a 0 C reading. A real reading at or above
+	 * 1 C still passes.
+	 */
